# Session Start Context

At the start of each session, the agent must align with project constraints
before making edits.

## Required reads

Read these files early in the session:

- `AGENTS.md`
- `TODO.md`
- `.cursor/rules/secrets-and-env.mdc`
- `.cursor/rules/public-private-boundary.mdc`
- `.cursor/rules/legal-readiness.mdc` when touching legal-sensitive flows

## Required behavior

- Respect the public/private boundary policy.
- Do not read or modify secret files without explicit user approval.
- If boundary classification is unclear, stop and ask.
- After completing substantial tasks, update `TODO.md`.
